# Malachor V, the Trayus Academy and Darth Sion (TSL, 903MAL, 906MAL,
# 903MAL, to 904MAL): the Elite Sith Assassin and the three groups of
# assassins in the entrance hall, the right (east) door and the curved
# hallway to the Proving Grounds (TO_906MALa), the Proving Grounds' turret
# rooms and Sith fought to their other way back (TO_903MALb), the Dark Jedi
# by Sion's chamber, and Darth Sion (tr_sion: n_darthsion002 at sp_sion,
# the SionDoors locked): his first word ("I bear no hatred for you, but I
# must pass"), four falls each with its talk (903sion, Sion's local number
# 13 counting them: 1 start 5, 2 start 4, 3 start 2, 4 start 0), the last
# his surrender, the truth that he can let go (light side), his death
# (a_sion: the SionDoors unlocked), and on into the Trayus Core.
# Starts from the remote's checkpoint (the Exile at the Academy's entrance,
# Sion's entrance scene played):
#   kjk playthrough tsl @malachor_academy data/routes/tsl/malachor_academy.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "The Trayus Academy", "The Trayus Proving
# Grounds" and "The End Game" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/); GameBanshee
# 61, 63; Kerbow [WMALTA], [WMALTS].
# Left: the Trayus Crescent (905MAL, the west side: the same foes), the
# Proving Grounds' workbench (99.89,-40.90) and its far south loop, the
# metal boxes, every [Persuade]/[Awareness]/[Wisdom]/[Intelligence] line to
# Sion (they only erode his will saves, Constitution and Wisdom).
#
# ASSUMES:
#   The Exile alone (the party emptied on the surface), the player again
#   (tr_sionenter's switch back from the remote).
#   No Persuade (c_sc_per_lt 17 fails every [Persuade]): the plain replies.
#   # UNSURE: the Proving Grounds' short way (FROM_903MALa north past the
#   turret rooms to TO_903MALb, 47 m) is open; DSimpson walks the long loop
#   by the workbench, which may be the only one.
#   # UNSURE: whether Sion's last fall ends in his death on the last reply
#   (E121's a_sion) or another fight; DSimpson: "Beat him four times".
fight 30             # the Elite Sith Assassin, then the hall's assassins
fight 30
fight 30
exit TO_906MALa      # the right door, the curved hallway: the Proving
module 906mal        # Grounds
fight 30
fight 30             # the turret rooms (G_TURRETBL006)
exit TO_903MALb      # back into the Academy, the east wing
module 903mal
fight 30             # the assassins and Dark Jedi by the metal boxes
fight 30
say Let us end this. I bear no hatred for you, but I must pass. # start 7
to tr_sion           # Sion's chamber: Sion (903sion)
talk
say But you can be defeated # start 5 (his first fall)
fight 40
talk
say Surrender now, Sion. I don't want to kill you. # start 4 (the second)
fight 40
talk
say You only delay the inevitable, Sith Lord. # start 2 (the third)
fight 40
talk
say You have already been defeated, Sion. # start 0 (the fourth, the last)
say Because I was able to turn away from it. And you could not.
say It is difficult, yes. But in making such decisions is what strength is.
say It is possible to live without the Force. And die without it.
say It is the truth, Sion... you feel it. Let go. # E117, E118, E120:
fight 40             # a_sion: he dies
talk
exit TO_904MAL       # the Trayus Core
module 904mal
save malachor_core
